,["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025 the middle sat at 58% of normal for August to September and 54% for October to November. Grid 24472 had its driest year in 1963, at 68%.</p>"}
